# refused:/blocked:/violation: emission with no why/remedy (or _afford, or a
# reasoned affordance-ok marker) nearby; --audit counts coverage per site. The
# fixture drives the guard over scratch repos, and checks the audit per site.
#
# STEP_SCRIPT is a LITERAL path on purpose (1063-nraf).
